      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَبًا</span></b> , applied to a man, [like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَبَآءٌ</span> mentioned in
art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عبأ</span>,] <i>Heavy, dull,</i> or <i>stupid;</i> or <i>coarse,</i> or
<i>rude;</i> and <i>impotent.</i> (ISd, TA.) [But see this
word in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عبى</span>.]

